        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>微积分公式表</title>\n<script>\n  MathJax = {\n    tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n  };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #000;\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 20px auto;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  .item {\n    flex: 1 1 30%;\n    min-width: 150px;\n    padding: 4px 6px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .item2 {\n    flex: 1 1 45%;\n    min-width: 200px;\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .stray-symbol {\n    flex: 0 0 30px;\n    padding-top: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  table, th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n  }\n  th, td {\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  th {\n    text-align: center;\n    background-color: #fafafa;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item\">⑫ $d(\\log_a x) = \\dfrac{1}{x\\ln a}dx$</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">⑬ $d(\\arcsin x) = \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}dx$</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">⑭ $d(\\arccos x) = -\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}dx$</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item\">⑮ $d(\\arctan x) = \\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}dx$</div>\n  <div class=\"stray-symbol\">$\\sqrt{\\ }$</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">⑯ $d(\\text{arc}\\cot x) = -\\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}dx$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section-title\">六、微分运算法则</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item2\">(1) $d(u\\pm v) = du \\pm dv$</div>\n  <div class=\"item2\">(2) $d(cu) = cdu$</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item2\">(3) $d(uv) = vdu + udv$</div>\n  <div class=\"item2\">(4) $d\\left(\\dfrac{u}{v}\\right) = \\dfrac{vdu-udv}{v^2}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section-title\">七、基本积分公式</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item\">(1) $\\int kdx = kx+c$</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">(2) $\\int x^\\mu dx = \\dfrac{x^{\\mu+1}}{\\mu+1}+c$</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">(3) $\\int \\dfrac{dx}{x} = \\ln|x|+c$</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item\">(4) $\\int a^x dx = \\dfrac{a^x}{\\ln a}+c$</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">(5) $\\int e^x dx = e^x+c$</div>\n  <div class=\"item\">(6) $\\int \\cos x\\,dx = \\sin x+c$</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item2\">(7) $\\int \\sin x\\,dx = -\\cos x+c$</div>\n  <div class=\"item2\">(8) $\\int \\dfrac{1}{\\cos^2 x}dx = \\int \\sec^2 x\\,dx = \\tan x+c$</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item2\">(9) $\\int \\dfrac{1}{\\sin^2 x}dx = \\int \\csc^2 x\\,dx = -\\cot x+c$</div>\n  <div class=\"item2\">(10) $\\int \\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}dx = \\arctan x+c$</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item2\">(11) $\\int \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}dx = \\arcsin x+c$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section-title\">八、补充积分公式</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item2\">$\\int \\tan x\\,dx = -\\ln|\\cos x|+c$</div>\n  <div class=\"item2\">$\\int \\cot x\\,dx = \\ln|\\sin x|+c$</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item2\">$\\int \\sec x\\,dx = \\ln|\\sec x+\\tan x|+c$</div>\n  <div class=\"item2\">$\\int \\csc x\\,dx = \\ln|\\csc x-\\cot x|+c$</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item2\">$\\int \\dfrac{1}{a^2+x^2}dx = \\dfrac{1}{a}\\arctan\\dfrac{x}{a}+c$</div>\n  <div class=\"item2\">$\\int \\dfrac{1}{x^2-a^2}dx = \\dfrac{1}{2a}\\ln\\left|\\dfrac{x-a}{x+a}\\right|+c$</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"item2\">$\\int \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}}dx = \\arcsin\\dfrac{x}{a}+c$</div>\n  <div class=\"item2\">$\\int \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}}dx = \\ln\\left|x+\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}\\right|+c$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section-title\">九、下列常用凑微分公式</div>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"width:65%;\">积分型</th>\n      <th style=\"width:35%;\">换元公式</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>$\\int f(ax+b)dx = \\dfrac{1}{a}\\int f(ax+b)\\,d(ax+b)$</td>\n      <td>$u = ax+b$</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>$\\int f(x^\\mu)x^{\\mu-1}\\,d\\,\\text{再}\\,\\dfrac{1}{\\mu}\\int f(x^\\mu)\\,d(x^\\mu)$</td>\n      <td>$u = x^\\mu$</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>$\\int f(\\ln x)\\cdot \\dfrac{1}{x}\\,d \\;=\\; \\int f(\\ln x)\\,d(\\ln x)$</td>\n      <td>$u = \\ln x$</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
